      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can't advise you to take any medication, but I can give you some general guidance. Combining naproxen with your existing medications, including Eliquis and low-dose aspirin, could be a bit of a challenge. Naproxen is a nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID), and taking it with Eliquis, which is an anticoagulant, might increase the risk of bleeding. I'd recommend you consult with your doctor about your current treatment plan and see if there are any adjustments that can be made to help manage your osteoarthritis symptoms.",
